{
  "job_B23.3.6.9_20251003_114607": {
    "chunk_text": "On annihte monan f\u00e6r to cyninge & bidde \u00fees \u00feu wille, ge \u00fe\u00e6t gif\u00f0, gang in to him on \u00fea \u00feridda tid \u00fees On II nihte monan gang \u00feonne & byge land, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feine yldran \u00e6r ahton, \u00feonne meht \u00feu hit alesan; And on On III nihtte monan far \u00feonne on \u00fein land & \u00feu hys \u00feonne wel gewaldest, & sec \u00feine freonde, & he beo\u00f0 On IIII nyhta monan sibba \u00fea cidenda men, & \u00feu hie gesibbast, & on \u00feone d\u00e6g sec \u00feine fiend, & \u00feu hie On V nihte monan gang to \u00feinum \u00feeahtere, & he \u00feonne \u00fee in eallum \u00feingum wel ge\u00feenge\u00f0, & sec on On VI nihtne monan do \u00feonne hig on \u00fein be\u00f0, \u00f0onne hafast \u00feu \u00fe\u00e6ron nenige wunelic sar, ac \u00feu \u00feer byst On VII nihtne monan bidde \u00feine laford, he \u00fee sele\u00f0; and gyf \u00feu wille fedan cynigas bearn o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00e6\u00f0eles Se VIII nihta monan geuntruma\u00f0, ne leofa\u00f0 he lange, ac he ys god on o\u00f0er land to feranne & wyf to On IX nihtte monan, fer to cyniges bene, gang in to him \u00e6t fulre seo, \u00feonne byst \u00feu gesundful wy\u00f0 hine. On X nihtne monan bidde swahwasswa \u00feu wylle, hyt \u00fee byo\u00f0 gere; Se X nihta mona he ys god to On XI nihta eald mona f\u00e6r on swahwelce healfe middangeardes swa \u00feu wylle, ne sce\u00f0 \u00fee n\u00e6nig wiht On XII nihte monan by\u00f0 god to feranne ofer s\u00e6 & on hird to ferenne & \u00e6ac to gewyfianne. On",
